Constant-pH Molecular Dynamics Extension

Contributing author: Mahdi Tavakol (University of Oxford)
Email: mahditavakol90@gmail.com

This fork of LAMMPS adds a complete framework for performing constant-pH molecular dynamics simulations using λ-dynamics and adaptive charge interpolation.
The method allows on-the-fly protonation and deprotonation of molecules or residues while maintaining overall charge neutrality through optional buffer ions.

The implementation extends the standard Nose-Hoover (NVT, NPT, and NH) integrators with additional λ degrees of freedom that evolve dynamically together with atomic coordinates.
Thermostatting of λ variables can be done via Andersen, Bussi, or Nose-Hoover schemes.
An optional total-charge constraint enforces electroneutrality when buffer particles are used.

The new package is fully parallelized, compatible with domain decomposition, and can be combined with all standard LAMMPS pair, bond, angle, and k-space styles.

Files added

constant_pH_structures.cpp, constant_pH_structures.h
Reads and stores charge templates for protonated and deprotonated states and broadcasts them to all ranks.

fix_constant_pH.cpp, fix_constant_pH.h
Core fix that manages λ variables, charge interpolation between protonated and deprotonated states, bias potentials, λ accelerations, and state output.

fix_adaptive_protonation.cpp, fix_adaptive_protonation.h
Detects changes in solvent exposure and adaptively updates the list of protonable molecules during the run.

fix_nh_constant_pH.cpp, fix_nh_constant_pH.h
Nose-Hoover-style λ integrator that supports Andersen, Bussi, and Nose-Hoover thermostats and optional total-charge constraints.

fix_nvt_constant_pH.cpp, fix_nvt_constant_pH.h
NVT ensemble version that creates a dedicated temperature compute for the λ subsystem.

fix_npt_constant_pH.cpp, fix_npt_constant_pH.h
NPT ensemble version that couples λ dynamics to a barostat and pressure compute.

compute_temp_constant_pH.cpp, compute_temp_constant_pH.h
Compute that includes λ kinetic energy when calculating temperature.

compute_GFF_constant_pH.cpp, compute_GFF_constant_pH.h
Computes the generalized free-energy correction (ΔG_FF) using finite-difference sampling of H(λ ± δ).

Files modified

fix_nh.cpp, fix_nh.h
Lightly modified version of the LAMMPS Nose-Hoover integrator exposing hooks for λ-coupling.
